.docs/plans/wave-W3/_prompts/_logs/DOS-296.log:1790:.docs/plans/wave-W3/_prompts/_logs/DOS-211.log:755:.docs/decisions/0105-provenance-as-first-class-output.md:437:The builder lifts `itemSource.sourcedAt` (when present in LLM output) and Glean document timestamps into `source_asof` automatically. Authors do not manually populate the field. The builder emits `SourceTimestampUnknown` when the population chain falls to step 4.
.docs/plans/wave-W3/_prompts/_logs/DOS-296.log:1791:.docs/plans/wave-W3/_prompts/_logs/DOS-211.log:756:.docs/decisions/0105-provenance-as-first-class-output.md:443:| DOS-211 (Provenance Builder, spine) | Builder lifts `sourcedAt` from `itemSource` JSON or Glean document metadata into `source_asof`. Emits `SourceTimestampUnknown` warning on full fallback. |
.docs/plans/wave-W3/_prompts/_logs/DOS-296.log:1792:.docs/plans/wave-W3/_prompts/_logs/DOS-211.log:757:.docs/decisions/0105-provenance-as-first-class-output.md:446:| DOS-218 / DOS-219 (pilot abilities, spine) | Acceptance criteria include: produces ≥1 claim with `source_asof` populated and ≥1 claim with `SourceTimestampUnknown` warning, demonstrating the chain works both ways. |
