.docs/plans/wave-W3/_prompts/_logs/DOS-296.log:2127:.docs/plans/wave-W3/_prompts/_logs/DOS-296.log:497:209:[ADR-0107](0107-source-taxonomy-alignment.md)'s `DataSource` enum is **not** extended with new variants for actors. `DataSource` describes the *origin of information* (Glean downstream, Clay, Gong transcript, user input). `actor` describes *who asserted the claim*. A single agent claim has `actor = 'agent:prepare_meeting:1.3'` and sources `[Glean { downstream: Salesforce }, Glean { downstream: Gong }]`. The two axes are orthogonal and remain so.
