.docs/plans/wave-W3/_prompts/_logs/DOS-296.log:2248:.docs/plans/wave-W3/_prompts/_logs/DOS-301.log:424:.docs/plans/v1.4.0-waves.md:544:- **Depends on:** W3-B (Provenance), W3-C (claim rows), W3-G (`source_asof`), W3-H (`temporal_scope`). All four must be merged.
