.docs/plans/wave-W3/_prompts/_logs/DOS-296.log:2406:.docs/plans/wave-W3/_prompts/_logs/DOS-300.log:844:.docs/decisions/0113-human-and-agent-analysis-as-first-class-claim-sources.md:215:- `actor` column on `intelligence_claims` with canonical values from §1.
