.docs/plans/wave-W3/_prompts/_logs/DOS-296.log:2573:.docs/plans/wave-W3/_prompts/_logs/DOS-211.log:835:The builder lifts `itemSource.sourcedAt` (when present in LLM output) and Glean document timestamps into `source_asof` automatically. Authors do not manually populate the field. The builder emits `SourceTimestampUnknown` when the population chain falls to step 4.
