     9	DOS-211 creates the provenance substrate every ability returns through `AbilityOutput<T>`. The Linear contract is explicit: "Implement the `Provenance` envelope shape, `TrustAssessment`, composition merge semantics, and `ProvenanceBuilder` helper. Every ability output is wrapped in `AbilityOutput<T>` with provenance." It also says the builder "fails at build time if any output field lacks attribution", `sources[]` is "own direct only", `children[]` carries transitive sources, and "Stable `composition_id` per declared `composes` entry (not positional `child_idx`)."
