    23	- `builder.rs` - `ProvenanceBuilder`, `ProvenanceError`, field coverage walk, budget/truncation logic.
    24	- `trust.rs` - `TrustAssessment`, `EffectiveTrust`, `TrustContribution`, trust merge.
    25	- `source.rs` - `SourceAttribution`, `DataSource`, `SourceIdentifier`, `ScoringClass`, source indexes.
    26	- `field.rs` - `FieldAttribution`, `FieldPath`, `SourceRef`, `DerivationKind`, `Confidence`, `SanitizedExplanation`.
    27	- `subject.rs` - `SubjectAttribution`, `SubjectRef`, subject-fit enums, competing-subject shape.
