    67	## 7. Integration with parallel wave-mates
    68	
    69	W3-A/DOS-210 owns the registry, `AbilityContext`, actor/mode policy, and erased `invoke_by_name_json` (`.docs/plans/wave-W3/DOS-210-plan.md:24-36`, `:76-84`). W5-A consumes those only. W3-B/DOS-211 owns `AbilityOutput<T>`, `ProvenanceBuilder`, `SourceAttribution`, `SubjectAttribution`, and finalize errors (`.docs/plans/wave-W3/DOS-211-plan.md:19-45`, `:57-67`).
    70	
