    74	
    75	## 8. Failure modes + rollback
    76	
    77	If malformed timestamps are found, the backfill writes quarantine rows and the migration halts before recording completion. Operators remediate or exclude via the quarantine workflow, then rerun. Implausible rows do not halt but appear in audit counts and provenance warnings.
    78	
