    41	
    42	Input validation: schema comes from W3-A `AbilityDescriptor.input_schema`, generated from ability input types (`.docs/plans/wave-W3/DOS-210-plan.md:24-30`). There is no per-surface or per-ability ad hoc validator. Tauri may inject the current `schema_version` only if W3-A exposes that defaulting API, per ADR-0102's internal-caller allowance (`.docs/decisions/0102-abilities-as-runtime-contract.md:174-179`); MCP rejects missing `schema_version` because it is external.
